// Sphere Waves: 2000 dots on a Fibonacci sphere breathing in waves of depth, their gradient's
// hues turning with time. A tap on the right picks a new pattern, on the left goes back one; a
// pinch moves the eye nearer or farther. RN: src/animations/sphere-waves/index.tsx. Drawn,
// tapped and pinched in Rust: gpu/src/sphere_waves.rs. The tap's selection haptic is the
// host's, at the touch-down (RN plays it at the tap's end).

component SphereWaves
  view
    // styles.container: black, flex 1; the canvas the window's size, absolute.
    column position="absolute" inset=0 background-color="#000000" testId="sphere-waves"
      canvas surface=sphere_waves() position="absolute" top=0 left=0 width="100%" height="100%"
        touch-action="none" -exact-press-haptic="selection" testId="sphere-waves-canvas"
        aria-label="Tap right for a new pattern, left to go back; pinch to zoom"
